":"Purity"},{"zh":"£trigger_no£ 我们已经为该阶段做好了选择。","en":"£trigger_no£ We have already made our choice for this stage."},{"zh":"克隆","en":"Cloning"},{"zh":"£trigger_no£ 我们已经为该阶段做好了选择。","en":"£trigger_no£ We have already made our choice for this stage."},{"zh":"变异","en":"Mutation"},{"zh":"£trigger_no£ 我们已经为该阶段做好了选择。","en":"£trigger_no£ We have already made our choice for this stage."}],"image":"art/d980bf6c63d25998dc6c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"bio.20","kind":"sequence","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"sequence","source":"common/situations/12_biogenesis_situations.txt:19","hooks":["on_progress_complete"],"story":"event-bio-1"},{"target":"bio.5","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"stage","delay":[{"days":"1"}],"source":"common/situations/12_biogenesis_situations.txt:29","hooks":["stage:stage_1","on_first_enter"],"story":"event-bio-1"}],"source":{"file":"common/situations/12_biogenesis_situations.txt","line":8}},{"id":"bio.20","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"既选之道","en":"The Path Taken"},"texts":[{"zh":"无论我们是为追求最纯粹的自我而奋斗，还是以克隆铺就成功之路，抑或是通过有意的基因突变来增强自我，此刻过后我们都将为自己的选择一往无前。","en":"Whether we strive for the purest form of ourselves, clone our way to success, or genetically augment ourselves through deliberate mutation, this moment marks a point of no return."},{"zh":"我们的本质始终是可塑的。我们是宇宙中最复杂的生命形式，借助我们的研究，我们将不断改变。\n\n未来是混沌的，而这正是我们所需要的。","en":"Our nature has always been malleable. We are the most complex lifeform in this universe, and with the help of our research we shall keep changing.\n\nThe future is chaotic, and that is perfect for us."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/d980bf6c63d25998dc6c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"bio.20.a","label":{"zh":"我们将深察纯净之真谛。","en":"We will know what it means to be pure."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"采纳传统树：['tradition_category:tradition_purity']","en":"Adopt Tradition Tree: ['tradition_category:tradition_purity']"}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"origin_evolutionary_predators","value":false,"label":{"zh":"演化猎手","en":"Evolutionary Predators"}}]],"allow":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"purity_unlock_level_1","path":"owner","value":true}]],"sets":["purity_tradition_unlocked"]},{"key":"bio.20.b","label":{"zh":"我们会以克隆通向成功。","en":"We will clone ourselves to success."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"采纳传统树：['tradition_category:tradition_cloning']","en":"Adopt Tradition Tree: ['tradition_category:tradition_cloning']"}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"origin_evolutionary_predators","value":false,"label":{"zh":"演化猎手","en":"Evolutionary Predators"}}]],"allow":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"cloning_unlock_level_1","path":"owner","value":true}]],"sets":["cloning_tradition_unlocked"]},{"key":"bio.20.c","label":{"zh":"我们将驾驭变异的力量。","en":"We will harness mutational powers."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"采纳传统树：['tradition_category:tradition_mutation']","en":"Adopt Tradition Tree: ['tradition_category:tradition_mutation']"}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"allow":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"mutation_unlock_level_1","path":"owner","value":true}]],"sets":["mutation_tradition_unlocked"]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/biogenesis_events.txt","line":437},"body":[{"pieces":[{"text":0}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"origin_evolutionary_predators","value":false,"label":{"zh":"演化猎手","en":"Evolutionary Predators"}}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":1}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"origin_evolutionary_predators","value":true,"label":{"zh":"演化猎手","en":"Evolutionary Predators"}}]]}],"sets":["situation_biogenesis_pause"]},{"id":"bio.5","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"本性可移","en":"Altering the Essence"},"texts":[{"zh":"为了加速进化，我们必须果断地选择出一条进行自我定义的道路。当开始意识到自己全部的潜力时，我们敏锐地意识到，这种努力可能从根本上改变我们的本质。\n\n设计进化是一项意义深远的任务。如今的变革亦将重塑我们的未来。","en":"To expedite our evolution, we must decisively select the path that will define our journey. As we begin to realize our full potential, we are acutely aware that this endeavor could fundamentally alter our very essence.\n\nEngineering evolution is a task of profound significance. The alterations we implement now will reshape our future."},{"zh":"为了加速进化，我们必须果断地选择出一条进行自我定义的道路。当开始意识到自己全部的潜力时，我们敏锐地意识到，这种努力可能从根本上改变我们的本质。\n\n设计进化是一项意义深远的任务。如今的变革亦将重塑我们的未来。\n\n为了开始自我的提升，现在必须选择旅程的第一步要踏向何方。","en":"To expedite our evolution, we must decisively select the path that will define our journey. As we begin to realize our full potential, we are acutely aware that this endeavor could fundamentally alter our very essence.\n\nEngineering evolution is a task of profound significance. The alterations we implement now will reshape our future.\n\nTo begin uplifting ourselves, we must now choose on which path we will begin our journey."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/d980bf6c63d25998dc6c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"bio.5.a","label":{"zh":"纯净之道。","en":"The path of Purity."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"situation","name":"cloning_approach_selected","path":"","value":false},{"type":"flag","scope":"situation","name":"mutation_approach_selected","path":"","value":false},{"type":"identity","key":"origin_evolutionary_predators","value":false,"label":{"zh":"演化猎手","en":"Evolutionary Predators"}},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"clone_army_full_potential","path":"owner","value":false}]]},{"key":"bio.5.b","label":{"zh":"克隆之道。","en":"The path of Cloning."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"situation","name":"purity_approach_selected","path":"","value":false},{"type":"flag","scope":"situation","name":"mutation_approach_selected","path":"","value":false},{"type":"identity","key":"origin_evolutionary_predators","value":false,"label":{"zh":"演化猎手","en":"Evolutionary Predators"}}]]},{"key":"bio.5.c","label":{"zh":"变异之道。","en":"The path of Mutation."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"situation","name":"purity_approach_selected","path":"","value":false},{"type":"flag","scope":"situation","name":"cloning_approach_selected","path":"","value":false},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"clone_army_full_potential","path":"owner","value":false}]]}],"next":[{"target":"bio.10","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/situations/12_biogenesis_situations.txt","hooks":["stage"],"story":"event-bio-1"},{"target":"origin.6115","kind":"condition","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"condition","group":"c2690","delay":[{"days":"5","random":"2"}],"when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"any_planet_within_border","arg":"{…}","scope":"","value":true}]]],"source":"events/biogenesis_events.txt:230","hooks":["after"],"story":"origin_fear_of_the_dark"}],"source":{"file":"events/biogenesis_events.txt","line":152},"body":[{"pieces":[{"text":0}],"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_one_genetic_ascension_choice","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":true}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":1}],"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_one_genetic_ascension_choice","arg":"no","scope":"owner","value":false}]]}],"sets":["situation_biogenesis_pause"]},{"id":"bio.10","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"转变点","en":"The Tipping Point"},"texts":[{"zh":"设计进化是一项意义深远的任务。我们现在拥有对基因特质、繁衍和基因测序的更深层次理解。\n\n我们进步的顶峰近在眼前。在短短几年内，我们将充分实现自身作为一个物种的全部潜力。","en":"Engineering our own evolution has led to profound advancements. We now possess a deeper understanding of genetic traits, reproduction, and DNA sequencing.\n\nThe culmination of our progress is within reach. In just a few years we will fully realize our potential as a species."},{"zh":"设计进化是一项意义深远的任务。我们现在拥有对基因特质、繁衍和基因测序的更深层次理解。\n\n我们进步的顶峰近在眼前。在短短几年内，我们将充分实现自身作为一个物种的全部潜力。\n\n然而在目前，我们还会继续在当前道路上前进，或为我们下一个发展阶段改变焦点。","en":"Engineering our own evolution has led to profound advancements. We now possess a deeper understanding of genetic traits, reproduction, and DNA sequencing.\n\nThe culmination of our progress is within reach. In just a few years we will fully realize our potential as a species.\n\nAt the present however, we may continue on our current path, or choose another focus for the next stage of our development."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/d980bf6c63d25998dc6c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"bio.10.a","label":{"zh":"专注纯净。","en":"Focus on Purity."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"situation","name":"cloning_approach_selected","path":"","value":false},{"type":"flag","scope":"situation","name":"mutation_approach_selected","path":"","value":false},{"type":"identity","key":"origin_evolutionary_predators","value":false,"label":{"zh":"演化猎手","en":"Evolutionary Predators"}},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"clone_army_full_potential","path":"owner","value":false}]]},{"key":"bio.10.b","label":{"zh":"专注克隆。","en":"Focus on Cloning."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"situation","name":"purity_approach_selected","path":"","value":false},{"type":"flag","scope":"situation","name":"mutation_approach_selected","path":"","value":false},{"type":"identity","key":"origin_evolutionary_predators","value":false,"label":{"zh":"演化猎手","en":"Evolutionary Predators"}}]]},{"key":"bio.10.c","label":{"zh":"专注变异。","en":"Focus on Mutation."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"situation","name":"purity_approach_selected","path":"","value":false},{"type":"flag","scope":"situation","name":"cloning_approach_selected","path":"","value":false},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"clone_army_full_potential","path":"owner","value":false}]]}],"next":[{"target":"bio.15","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage",